        "title": "The Witness's Frame",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "12. CONSTANTS, PARAMETERS, NUMBERS\n      (subsidies, taxes, standards)\n      ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n      Solon's seisachtheia: debt cancellation, recalibrated wealth\n      thresholds for Athenian political classes.\n      Gladstone's tax reform: shifted fiscal burden.\n      These matter. They also get reversed by the next government."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-WITNESS-FRAME.md#009",
      "path": [
        "00-WITNESS-FRAME.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:political-reformers:00-witness-frame, git-history:political-reformers:00-witness-frame]",
