        "title": "The Witness's Frame",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "10. STOCK-AND-FLOW STRUCTURE\n      (physical infrastructure, transport, networks)\n      ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n      Addams's Hull House: built a physical institution that\n      changed what flowed through a neighborhood (education,\n      healthcare, culture where there had been none).\n      Owen's New Lanark: restructured the factory itself."
    }
